# Per-lesson delivery artefacts, regenerated from the lesson on demand.
# HOUSE-STYLE §11a: the self-contained preview is what gets SENT with a
# build — every image inlined as a data: URI so it opens standalone — which
# makes it a multi-megabyte near-duplicate of a file already tracked here.
# The PDF is a print export of the same deck. Neither belongs on origin/main.
# (Worksheets and source PDFs that live in lesson folders are unaffected.)
*-PREVIEW.html
/forbes-risk-management-c1-c2.pdf
